en:
Was it because the banners were swapped?{w}From deep within the Churos Highlands,
an ominous presence swells up!{w}{p}But neither you nor Nishimikado
could do anything about it...{w}First, you should report to Rondelgius.{w}

"Adventurers, eh? What a coincidence, meeting you in a place like this!{w}Did you know?
This is the keep of the Churos Highlands."{w}{p}"Thanks to my war banner,
these highlands are kept under guard.{w}You may adventure in peace!"{w}

This seems to be the royal tomb where
the ancestors of the ogres and goblins are buried.{w}{p}It's Montana who has business here.{w}It would be best to bring Montana along
from Baroque Fort.{w}
